WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:03.444
India has over 15,000
kilometres of land border.

00:00:03.529 --> 00:00:04.739
What if all of it closed?

00:00:04.905 --> 00:00:09.635
Six land neighbours: Pakistan, China,
Nepal, Bhutan, Bangladesh and Myanmar.

00:00:09.925 --> 00:00:12.295
Trade by road and rail
would stop overnight.

00:00:12.436 --> 00:00:15.686
Nepal and Bhutan are
landlocked and depend on India.

00:00:15.811 --> 00:00:17.461
They would feel it just as hard.

00:00:17.547 --> 00:00:20.977
But most of India's trade by
volume already goes by sea,

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:24.737
through a coastline of
about 7,500 kilometres.

00:00:25.032 --> 00:00:26.782
The real damage would be regional:

00:00:27.212 --> 00:00:29.742
border towns,
local trade and supply lines.

00:00:29.862 --> 00:00:31.472
Which border hurts India most?

00:00:31.603 --> 00:00:32.233
Comment.

